Original work belongs to the DIV Games Studio contributors. This is an
independent derivative, not an official DIV release.

Retained/adapted components:
- divwindo.c: indexed drawing, gradient table, bitmap text and button bevels.
- div.c: front-at-zero window stack; adapted window lifecycle, collision
  dimming, moving outlines and the extrude opening effect. The SDL animation
  advances by elapsed time rather than blocking the event loop.
- divedit.c: line cache/contiguous buffer and insertion, deletion, splitting,
  joining and navigation, adapted for general text and UTF-8 scalar positions.
- system/SYS08X11.BIN and system/grande.fon: unchanged original bitmap fonts.
- system/GRAF_G.DIV: unchanged icon role pixels 1, 2, 35, 37, 39, 40, 43,
  51, 52, 55 and 56, embedded in src/div_icons.h; cursor control points retained.

SDL events/presentation, bounded drawing adapters, file safety, POSIX browser,
Unicode validation, history, clipboard, help and build integration are new or
adapted for DIVseed under GPLv3. Existing upstream comments are retained.

src/unicode_font.h contains DIVseed Unicode, a generated bitmap fallback
from DejaVu Sans Mono. The Bitstream Vera license and DejaVu notices are
included in assets/UNICODE-FONT-LICENSE. The original ASCII font stays in use.
